<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Feed group buys 56,000 tonnes U.S. corn.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Feed group buys 56,000 tonnes U.S. corn.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Members Feed Industry Group bought a 56,000-tonne shipment of U.S. No.2 corn from Zennoh at a tender on Friday, traders said.  </p>
<p>The shipment was bought on a cost-and-freight basis.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follow:</p>
<p>	   U.S. Gulf  Pacific N.W.</p>
<p>	   Oct 1-15   Oct 16-30</p>
<p> 38,000				  $171.15</p>
<p> 18,000				    99.73 US cents/Dec</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
